I like to write in my spare time. Here are a few things I've written and made public.

Please note that I have NOT used AI to create or assist in the creation of any of my written works whatsoever (with the exception of research).
Although AI is a fascinating and powerful tool I think its use in arts at the moment should be extremely conservative to preserve one's self-expression.

